  <p id="c-liangshu-043-weizang:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-liangshu-043-weizang:p001:m0000" ref="axs_5y7_p7w_AAAA">粲</persName>長子<persName id="c-liangshu-043-weizang:p001:m0003" ref="axs_5y7_p7w_AAAAA">臧</persName>，字<persName id="c-liangshu-043-weizang:p001:m0006" ref="axs_5y7_p7w_AAAAA">君理</persName>。歷官尚書三公郎、太子洗馬、東宮領直。<persName id="c-liangshu-043-weizang:p001:m0027" ref="5d1_8jg_amy">侯景</persName>至，帥兵屯西華門。城陷，奔江州，收舊部曲，據豫章，爲其部下所害。</p>
